# Browser
# As a person sees it: Loki's two abilities are told apart on its menu, each with its cost. Once "{1}, {T}: When you next
# cast ..." has resolved, the delayed ability sits on no card, so the page says it beside Bot1's life total, named for Loki.
# Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot2; the copy asks for its new targets, and Bot1 keeps Bot2. The ability is used up
# (CR 603.7c): nothing waits any more, and Bot2 has taken 3 + 3.

